cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or its artifacts, please cite the paper."
title: "CARE-GS: coverage-aware rate reduction for 3D Gaussian Splatting assets"
abstract: >-
  Measures what a re-compression does to a per-pixel quality guarantee that travels with a 3D Gaussian Splatting
  asset, gives the recipient a one-render-pass audit, and shows that the action family (quantisation vs pruning)
  rather than the compression strength decides whether the guarantee survives.
authors:
